      "writtenOn": "2024-01-18T17:02:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You should use `ap_power_ev_init_callback()` and `ap_power_ev_add_callback()` instead of using the legacy DECLARE_HOOK.\n\nExample here registers a callback for both resume and suspend.\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/HEAD:src/platform/ec/zephyr/program/corsola/src/board_chipset.c;l\u003d45",
      "range": {
